OL,1,V~}4V,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$,,$,$,((G 3/10
OL,2,Vj5$D]GNuntii ex Archivio Latini 2012   
OL,3,V*/%E]     G  NUNTII LATINI             
OL,6,FPONTIFICIA ACADEMIA ...                
OL,8, "Nostris quoque temporibus Latinae     
OL,9, linguae et cultus cognitio perquam est 
OL,10, necessaria ad fontes investigandos, ex 
OL,11, quibus complures disciplinae ceteroqui 
OL,12, hauriunt ..."                          
OL,14, "In hodierno tamen cultu, humanarum    
OL,15, litterarum extenuatis studiis,         
OL,16, periculum adest levioris linguae       
OL,17, Latinae cognitionis, quae in curriculis
OL,18, philosophicis theologicisque futurorum 
OL,19, presbyterorum quoque animadvertitur."  
OL,22,V,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
